    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35502" root="قرض" body-key="q">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انقرضوا</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>They passed away,</i> or <i>perished,</i> [as
though cut off,] (S, K,) <i>all of them,</i> (K,) <i>not one
of them remaining;</i> (S;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُرِضُوا</span></b>  [perhaps
a mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرِضُوا</span>: see 1]. (TA.)

